{"chapter":{"id":97,"nameSimple":"Al-Qadr","nameArabic":"القدر","translatedName":"The Power","versesCount":5,"revelationPlace":"makkah"},"verses":[{"id":6126,"verseKey":"97:1","verseNumber":1,"arabic":"إِنَّآ أَنزَلۡنَٰهُ فِي لَيۡلَةِ ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","translation":"Indeed, We sent it [i.e., the Qur’ān] down during the Night of Decree.","transliteration":"innā anzalnāhu fī laylati l-qadri","audioUrl":"/audio/7/097001.mp3","segments":[[0,1,150,2890],[1,2,2900,5410],[2,3,5420,5880],[3,4,5890,6710],[4,5,6720,7260]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"إِنَّآ","translation":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā"},{"position":2,"text":"أَنزَلۡنَٰهُ","translation":"revealed it","transliteration":"anzalnāhu"},{"position":3,"text":"فِي","translation":"in","transliteration":"fī"},{"position":4,"text":"لَيۡلَةِ","translation":"(the) Night","transliteration":"laylati"},{"position":5,"text":"ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","translation":"(of) Power","transliteration":"l-qadri"}]},{"id":6127,"verseKey":"97:2","verseNumber":2,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا لَيۡلَةُ ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","translation":"And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree?","transliteration":"wamā adrāka mā laylatu l-qadri","audioUrl":"/audio/7/097002.mp3","segments":[[0,1,40,390],[1,2,400,3200],[2,3,3210,3630],[3,4,3640,4430],[4,5,4440,4990]],"words":[{"position":1,"text":"وَمَآ","translation":"And what","transliteration":"wamā"},{"position":2,"text":"أَدۡرَىٰكَ","translation":"can make you know","transliteration":"adrāka"},{"position":3,"text":"مَا","translation":"what","transliteration":"mā"},{"position":4,"text":"لَيۡلَةُ","translation":"(the) Night","transliteration":"laylatu"},{"position":5,"text":"ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","translation":"(of) Power (is)","transliteration":"l-qadri"}]},{"id":6128,"verseKey":"97:3","verseNumber":3,"arabic":"لَيۡلَةُ ٱلۡقَدۡرِ خَيۡرٞ مِّنۡ أَلۡفِ شَهۡرٖ","translation":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months.","transliteration":"laylatu l-qadri khayrun min alfi shahrin","audioUrl":"/audio/7/097003.mp3